OL,1,V7w3s7s35                        C G6/13
OL,2,V55555555CBRINKS MAT: FLEMING
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CMAY BE BACK TONIGHT
OL,5, John Fleming, the man Scotland Yard
OL,6, wants to question about the #26m Brinks
OL,7, -Mat bullion raid, could be on his way
OL,8, back to London from the US tonight.
OL,10, Fleming, 45, already on board a London-
OL,11, bound jet, earlier won a last minute
OL,12, reprieve when a federal judge in Miami
OL,13, deferred his deportation.
OL,15, But now Venezuela is said to have
OL,16, cancelled Fleming's visa to go there -
OL,17, immigration officials had given him a
OL,18, chance to find a third country to go to
OL,20, Peru withdrew a visa permitting him to
OL,21, go there after the Govt contacted them.
OL,23,F]DFrom 18-03-87 / teletextarchive.com
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
