OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F496A1773846228
OL,1,V7w3s7s35                          G7/13
OL,2,V55555555CKEY IRANGATE MEN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5C'TO GET IMMUNITY'
OL,4,B
OL,5, Key Iran arms scandal witnesses John
OL,6, Poindexter and Oliver North look set to
OL,7, be granted limited immunity from
OL,8, prosecution to obtain their testimony.
OL,10, The special Congressional committees
OL,11, investigating the affair announced
OL,12, their approval of the plan.
OL,14, But they will "hold off" for 90 days
OL,15, before hearing the testimony.
OL,17, The delay was requested by independent
OL,18, prosecutor Lawrence Walsh, who is
OL,19, conducting his own probe.
OL,21, Mr Poindexter and Lt Col North have so
OL,22, far consistently refused to testify.
OL,23,F]DFrom 18-03-87 / teletextarchive.com
