OL,1,V7w3s7s35E                         G8/13
OL,2,V55555555CUNCARING, SWEARING
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CDOCTOR STRUCK OFF
OL,5, A doctor was struck off the medical
OL,6, register for being rude and abusive to
OL,7, colleagues and failing to give some
OL,8, patients the urgent attention needed.
OL,10, Dr Jennifer Colman-Archer, 43, of East
OL,11, Dereham, Norfolk, called fellow doctors
OL,12, "poof" and "coon", and said a heart
OL,13, attack victim was "a silly bugger".
OL,15, The GMC found her guilty of serious
OL,16, professional misconduct. Then it was
OL,17, revealed she had convictions for drink
OL,18, driving and assaulting two policemen.
OL,20, The GMC heard she sometimes failed to
OL,21, keep proper records and would write
OL,22, notes saying "it's the wobblies".
OL,23,F]DFrom 18-03-87 / teletextarchive.com
